WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.400
What did the record show at this exact moment?
TIMELY AGENT turns longitudinal data into an inspectable answer.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:11.800
Start with a synthetic record.
Choose a patient, a question and a model without exposing real patient data.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:18.200
Why freeze the decision time?
The agent can only use information available by this point in the record.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:25.600
Follow the answer and the evidence together.
Current findings remain distinct from earlier clinical episodes.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:32.000
What supports the conclusion?
The timeline keeps the clinical course and decision boundary visible.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:41.400
Open any conclusion to inspect its evidence.
Rules stay connected to the guideline passages that define them.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:49.800
The trace shows how the answer was assembled.
Engine runs, record reads, model calls and timings remain auditable.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:59.200
Compare trajectories, not just final labels.
Synthetic cases align at onset so divergent courses become visible.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:05.000
TIMELY AGENT connects clinical knowledge, temporal reasoning and auditability.
Explore the public project at timely-agent.com.
